# Summary

The statute specifies a retention rule for records of the society. Records are retained for the period named in the schedule of this statute [[cite:obs-411537736d52f792750b15761a2a2ef04ee8b2e3 "Records of the society are retained for the period named in the schedule of this statute."]].

The statute's retention rule is that records must be kept according to the schedule specified within the statute [[cite:obs-411537736d52f792750b15761a2a2ef04ee8b2e3 "Records of the society are retained for the period named in the schedule of this statute."]].
